Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.41,0:00:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello大家好我是安超
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.75,0:00:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,今天是10月13号星期二
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.36,0:00:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我今天打算
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.58,0:00:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,,跑一堂高驰的跑步能力测试
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.72,0:00:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在的手表
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.52,0:00:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,给我的乳酸阈值是4:21
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.34,0:00:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,乳酸阈配速
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.71,0:00:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,乳酸阈心率是185
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.10,0:00:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,但我觉得
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.67,0:00:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,可能有点不准
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.06,0:00:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,一个是我觉得这个
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.83,0:00:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,数据可能是偏夏天的数据
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.77,0:00:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,现在进入秋天了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.73,0:00:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,这个数据我可能会有一些失真
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.99,0:00:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,所以今天
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.05,0:00:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,打算跑一节乳酸阈配速看一看
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.42,0:00:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,并且我还想看一下我距离破三
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.23,0:00:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,到底还差多少
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.57,0:00:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,给大家看一下
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.17,0:00:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,乳酸阈配速大概会怎么跑
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.59,0:00:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道能不能看到
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.73,0:00:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,可能看不到我自己念一下
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.29,0:01:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,首先是慢跑5分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.18,0:01:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,然后是一个匀速的25分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.34,0:01:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,配速在4:50到4:25之间
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.10,0:01:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,最后是一个也不是最后吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.49,0:01:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,可能是最后了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.23,0:01:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,就是有一个3分钟的4:20
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.87,0:01:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,到4:00的一个匀速跑
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.77,0:01:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,然后是一个再来3分钟的4:00
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.55,0:01:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,到3:35的一个匀速跑
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.54,0:01:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,如果这时候还没测出来大概
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.61,0:01:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,会再补充一个3分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.33,0:01:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我估计大概也是不会的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.04,0:01:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我已经测过很多次
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.52,0:01:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,高驰的能力测试了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.26,0:01:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,一般跑两次这种
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.92,0:01:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,3分钟就可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.59,0:01:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,行我们准备吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.11,0:01:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,整个测试过程
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.39,0:01:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,是不能中途暂停的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.25,0:01:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,所以会从热身5分钟开始
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.76,0:02:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,就立刻进入整个
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.80,0:02:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,测试的环节了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.71,0:02:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,OK已经开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.53,0:02:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,热身大概是5分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.05,0:02:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,其实我在今年
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.37,0:02:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,1月1号参加了一场
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.00,0:02:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,上海的迎新跑
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.65,0:02:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,就是嘉定的那个
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.47,0:02:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,F1赛车的那个赛场
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.93,0:02:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,绕圈跑迎新跑当时
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.57,0:02:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,半马跑官方成绩是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.17,0:02:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,1小时29分30秒左右
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.95,0:02:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,但是那个距离会跑得比较多嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.91,0:02:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,大概跑了21.5
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.21,0:02:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我的实际的21.195的成绩呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.81,0:02:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,大概是1小时27左右
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.49,0:02:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,所以那场比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.87,0:02:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,跑完之后
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.12,0:02:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,高驰立刻把我的乳酸阈配速
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.19,0:03:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,从4:10
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.39,0:03:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,更新了为4:01
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.55,0:03:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,所以
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.62,0:03:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,在那之后
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.84,0:03:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,很长一段时间
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.67,0:03:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我的乳酸阈配速一直
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.36,0:03:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,都是在4:01、4:02左右
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.05,0:03:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,但是后来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.27,0:03:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,经历了春节
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.74,0:03:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,和3月份的旅游
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.18,0:03:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我差不多
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.18,0:03:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,停了有小1个月
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.52,0:03:37.09,Default,,0,0,0,,当然也不是完全停
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.85,0:03:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,这2月我的总跑量80多
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.63,0:03:42.67,Default,,0,0,0,,3月总跑量
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.07,0:03:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,100多
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.51,0:03:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,就这两个月导致我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.36,0:03:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,能力大幅下降
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.45,0:03:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,当时还有伤病下降了之后
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.24,0:03:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,高驰的更新
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.82,0:04:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,乳酸阈策略不是那么激进
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.08,0:04:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,所以一直
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.30,0:04:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,到7月份
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.87,0:04:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,手表给我的乳酸阈配速都是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.94,0:04:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,4:01但其实
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.22,0:04:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我是知道
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.26,0:04:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我的乳酸阈配速
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.12,0:04:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,肯定早就不是4:0x秒了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.03,0:04:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我当时
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.25,0:04:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,又做了一次在7月份的时候做了一次
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.93,0:04:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,乳酸阈测试
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.65,0:04:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,然后乳酸阈配速
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.24,0:04:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,大概就掉到了4:15
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.41,0:04:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,4:18左右
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.82,0:04:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,后来进入
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.64,0:04:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,夏天高温跑不动
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.12,0:04:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,然后乳酸阈配速一直掉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.07,0:04:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,掉到了现在的4:21
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.28,0:04:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我今天
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.50,0:04:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,就试一下
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.02,0:04:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,趁着天气
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.57,0:04:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,已经变凉快了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.01,0:04:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我先纠正一下看
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.03,0:04:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.37,0:04:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是我的乳酸阈配速
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.26,0:05:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,真的就是4:21
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.73,0:05:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,4:21
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.22,0:05:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,还是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.43,0:05:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,其实更快
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.34,0:05:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,这个还是能后续指导我的训练
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.27,0:05:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,以及让我能认识到
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.64,0:05:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我离破三
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.22,0:05:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,到底还差多远
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.60,0:05:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,一个很重要的指标吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.12,0:05:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,所以现在我比较感觉是有点喘
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.80,0:05:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,这个状态也许
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.96,0:05:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,不是很好无所谓继续吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.92,0:05:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,还有10分还有11分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.01,0:05:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,这个我就是尽量
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.99,0:05:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,这25分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.53,0:05:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,尽量匀速保持在4:30左右
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.01,0:05:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,4:25左右
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.50,0:05:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,心率不是很高才
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.13,0:05:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,,170出头不知道为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.77,0:05:56.23,Default,,0,0,0,,就这样吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.14,0:05:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,等会再见
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.36,0:06:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,第二段已经开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.85,0:06:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我有点
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.15,0:06:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉到吃力了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.94,0:06:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我尽量贴着4:00吧不一定能跑到现在
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.55,0:06:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,还能说话可能
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.75,0:06:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,第三段的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.32,0:06:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,估计就没法
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.89,0:06:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,说话了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.39,0:06:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,现在还有2分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.66,0:06:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,继续马上
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.29,0:06:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,进入到下一组冲了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.71,0:06:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,最后3分钟快完了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.55,0:06:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,快结束
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.54,0:06:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,5分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.49,0:06:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,放松
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.90,0:06:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,休息等会再见
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.59,0:07:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才做完测试了以后不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.27,0:07:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么我想继续跑
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.43,0:07:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,,结果手表上我点继续了以后
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.19,0:07:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,一直在滴滴滴的叫
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.13,0:07:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,当时也没搞懂为什么(可能是恢复心率?)
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.78,0:07:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我就把那个
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.70,0:07:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,测试给停掉了我重新开表
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.54,0:07:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,重新开始
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.76,0:07:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,跑了跑了一会儿大概又跑了4公里吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.02,0:07:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,反正总共
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.24,0:07:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,跑了13点几公里差不多
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.92,0:07:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,后面主要是放松了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.96,0:07:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,慢摇了4公里
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.88,0:07:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,说一下测试结果
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.22,0:07:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这次测试
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.14,0:07:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,之前乳酸阈配速
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.83,0:07:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,手表给我的是4:21
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.92,0:07:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,测完之后
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.29,0:07:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,更新为乳酸阈配速4:16
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.81,0:07:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,乳酸阈心率185
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.98,0:07:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,个人最大心率208
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.46,0:07:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,乳酸阈心率和最大心率没变化
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.73,0:07:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,就是乳酸阈配速
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.84,0:08:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,4:16、4:16
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.04,0:08:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,提高了5秒
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.51,0:08:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,从4:21提高到4:16大概
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.67,0:08:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,就是提升了5秒
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.11,0:08:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,但是无论怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.93,0:08:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,测完结果
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.19,0:08:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,大概就对自己已经有数了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.07,0:08:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀我的水平
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.32,0:08:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,离破三真的遥遥无期啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.57,0:08:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我们
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.90,0:08:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,知道破三
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.59,0:08:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,需要的配速
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.65,0:08:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,是至少要
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.95,0:08:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,4:15、4:15都不一定能破三
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.37,0:08:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,而我的乳酸阈配速
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.66,0:08:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,手表给出来是4:16
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.04,0:08:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么办呢还得练
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.21,0:08:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,加油吧继续努力
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.72,0:08:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,之前全马预测
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.54,0:08:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,那我在4:21的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.09,0:08:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,手表给我的全马
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.05,0:08:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,预测是3小时20分左右
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.65,0:08:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,估计现在更新到
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.12,0:08:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,4:16、4:15、4:16的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.35,0:08:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,乳酸阈配速
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.07,0:08:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,全马能跑到3:15了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.83,0:08:58.49,Default,,0,0,0,,那我重新调整一下
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.71,0:08:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,这次
